{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kaho.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她自己跑来事务所",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kaho.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kaho.second",
    "idolId": "kaho",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "明明平时总是困困的样子，好厉害！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "总觉得……像是去救遇险英雄的正义伙伴！",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原来如此……那个我也懂。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "对吧！好帅啊——",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "在这里的话，我觉得真的能成为英雄！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "果穗是偶像，不是英雄啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "诶，英雄吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。刚才我们正说，果穗说不定能成为像英雄那样的人。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "我总有一天也能成为英雄那样吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这个嘛……",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "正因为能，我才会挖你。",
            "nextNodeId": "20"
          },
          {
            "label": "果穗是想成为吧？",
            "nextNodeId": "30"
          },
          {
            "label": "只有练习一条路！",
            "nextNodeId": "40"
          }
        ]
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "果穗能像英雄一样让所有人笑起来……我觉得你能成为这样的偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "真的吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。为了这个，我也会好好带你的。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "我像英雄一样……那，帅气的姿势也需要吧！！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "现在就得想好！什么样的姿势才帅呢——",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈。姿势也重要，不过先从练习开始。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今后，一起加油吧。"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是，我想成为！",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，很好的回答。那份心情的强度很重要。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "啊。那个，我听过！",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "我最喜欢的特摄节目里也说过，向上心很重要！",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "果然偶像和英雄很像呢！",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "确实如此。偶像和英雄，要让所有人一直笑下去，都需要向上心。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以，朝着更高的地方，一起战斗吧。"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "想像英雄一样，每天的练习就少不了。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "英雄也说每天的特训很重要！说为了保护大家的笑容，每天的训练是必要的！",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "为了保护大家的笑容，偶像也需要每天练习呢！",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。而且，果穗身上应该还睡着很厉害的力量。",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "潜在能力！我知道！是沉睡的力量！",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对。为了解放那份力量，首先也是练习。",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！为了成为能让所有人笑起来的、像英雄一样的偶像……"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "果穗——差不多到上课的时间了……",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "哇……！",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "啊，制作人先生！果然办公室好厉害啊！",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "像英雄的秘密基地一样，好开心！",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是、是吗。对果穗来说确实很稀奇吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "是！……啊！制作人先生，你看你看！",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……叶月小姐怎么了？",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "kaho",
        "text": "她打字的速度好快！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
